      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "Spanish has two ways to make passives:",
          "",
          "1. SER + PARTICIPLE (formal):        Press 1",
          "El libro fue escrito por Cervantes.",
          "(The book was written by Cervantes.)",
          "La ley será aprobada mañana.",
          "(The law will be approved tomorrow.)",
          "",
          "2. SE + VERB (more natural):         Press 2",
          "Se habla español aquí.",
          "(Spanish is spoken here.)",
          "Se venden autos usados.",
          "(Used cars are sold.)",
          "Se construyó el puente en un año.",
          "(The bridge was built in a year.)",
          "",
          "The SE form is much more common in",
          "everyday Spanish."
