        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "SE has many uses. Don't confuse them:",
          "",
          "PASSIVE SE:                          Press 1",
          "Se habla español.",
          "(Spanish is spoken.)",
          "",
          "IMPERSONAL SE (people in general):   Press 2",
          "Se dice que... (They say that...)",
          "Se puede entrar. (One can enter.)",
          "",
          "REFLEXIVE SE:                        Press 3",
          "Ella se mira en el espejo. (She looks",
